      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2010, Copyright the Author. Journal compilation © 2010, Wiley Periodicals, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "Several studies have reported a good pain relief effect from sterile water injections, especially for low back pain, during labor. The aim of this paper was to illustrate the use of the method in a clinical childbirth situation by means of a descriptive case report. The woman in the report described that the method provided a powerful pain relief effect, measured by a visual analog scale, and that her experience was highly positive."
      },
